+
+## Intent
+
+**Problem:** The public `/apply/:code` form renders ~36 controls on one long page (80% mobile) and abandons at ~89%: daunt at first render plus an unguided document wall. Spec of record: `_bmad-output/planning-artifacts/problem-solving-application-form-completion-2026-07-31.md` (F1/F4/F5 rows, Wave 1 build pack).
+
+**Approach:** Progressive-enhancement stepper over the existing 8 SSR sections (named sticky progress, per-step validation gating, single POST, no-JS fallback stays the long form), plus field diet (drop the optional non-scoring `listing_source` select; collapse the optional address cluster into `<details>`) and camera-roll-friendly per-slot upload helper copy.
+
+## Boundaries & Constraints
+
+**Always:**
+- `data-section-id` values + section DOM order unchanged (funnel keys off them); `apply_analytics.js` and `form.js` untouched.
+- Single POST at the end; submit/consent/honeypot/timing machinery untouched.
+- No-JS fallback: SSR renders all 8 sections visible and submittable as today.
+- Scoring inputs untouched — no removing/renaming/re-requiring any field in `ai_client.gleam`'s payload (address cluster + `eircode` stay, only visually collapsed).
+- `view_prep_block()` and its `F3-SEAM` comment byte-untouched (follow-up C seam).
+- Applicant-facing strings live in `server/src/copy.gleam`; brand voice (calm, specific; never "Error/Failed/Retry").
+- `listing_source` stays accepted server-side: DB column, `is_valid_listing_source`, `error_summary` label, and `work_income.listing_source_options` const + parity test remain (cached pages may still post it).
+
+**Ask First:**
+- Reintroducing `listing_source` post-submit (confirmation widget + endpoint) — deferred follow-up, not this PR.
+- Any change to the prep block copy or the one-visit line.
+
+**Never:**
+- Per-section persistence, localStorage drafts, magic continue links (follow-up C's job).
+- Dropping the `listing_source` column or rejecting the field server-side.
+- A JS-generated "review summary" of entered values (rejected: PII-echo + scope; Back navigation covers review).
+- Merging the PR.
+
+## I/O & Edge-Case Matrix
+
+| Scenario | Input / State | Expected Output / Behavior | Error Handling |
+|----------|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|
+| Advance | Step's visible required filled, Continue | Next section shown, others `hidden`; progress "Step N of 8 — Name"; `rt:form-step-changed` `{step_index, section_id, total}`; focus legend, scroll to top of section | N/A |
+| Gating | Visible required empty, Continue | Stay; `.has-error` + short brand-voice message in the field's `.field-error`; focus first invalid | Clears on input/next pass |
+| Radio group | Required, none checked | Blocks; valid when any visible member checked | Same inline pattern |
+| Conditional hidden | Required control inside `hidden` conditional (guarantor off, pet details…) | Skipped by gating (visibility walk mirrors apply_analytics) | N/A |
+| Dynamic required | `employment_status=employed` (employer fields gain `required`) | Empty visible employer field blocks | Existing toggle supplies `required` |
+| Error re-render | `data-apply-page="form-errors"` | Stepper starts at first `.has-error` section; error-summary anchor clicks switch step + focus target; banner keeps initial focus | Falls back to step 1 |
+| No JS | Script absent/blocked | All 8 sections visible; one POST submits; server validation authoritative | Existing path |
+| Files across steps | Files chosen, then Back/Continue | Inputs keep `FileList`; preflight/submit unchanged | Server caps authoritative |
+
