+- Gating duplicates ~30 lines of apply_analytics' visibility rules with a keep-in-sync comment — plain static JS has no cross-file imports, and apply_analytics.js must stay untouched.
+- `listing_source` dropped (not post-submit): spec grants either; a confirmation widget needs a new public mutation endpoint + application-identity token — large surface for a "small" fold-in. Ops digest degrades to `(unknown)` on new rows; PostHog referrers still show channel. Open follow-up.
+- `rt:form-step-changed` is the documented seam for follow-up C's save-on-section-change.
+- Stepper runs on the error page because anchor links into `hidden` sections are dead ends otherwise; it never steals the banner's first focus.
